<title>USA: HealthCor says buys CareNetwork of Ark..</title>
<headline>HealthCor says buys CareNetwork of Ark..</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthCor Holdings Inc said Monday it has bought all the outstanding stock of CareNetwork Inc, a privately owned company.</p>
<p>The company said it is not disclosing terms of the deal.</p>
<p>The company said CareNetwork provides home nursing services in Arkansas. It had about $16 millon in revenue for the year ended August 17, 1996.</p>
